Ideas taken from third-party projects, without their code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Odyssey — https://github.com/zju-vipa/Odyssey
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 MineDojo Team. Built on Voyager
(https://github.com/MineDojo/Voyager).

`src/skills/` takes the idea of its `SkillManager`: keep a procedure that
worked, have it described, and retrieve it by meaning when a similar request
returns. **No line of Odyssey is copied.** Its implementation rests on
langchain, Chroma and OpenAI embeddings, which ADR-017, ADR-014 and ADR-015
respectively rule out here; this platform's own SemanticIndex and
SQLiteVectorStore are used instead.

The attribution stands whether or not code was copied: the idea is theirs, and
saying so costs nothing while omitting it would be a discourtesy to a project
that published its work under a permissive licence.
